2. Any of the following cardiovascular and cerebrovascular diseases occurred within 6 months before screening:

   1. congestive heart failure(NYHA stage III),myocardial infarction,unstable angina pectoris,congenital long QT syndrome,Anterior left block,coronary angioplasty,stent implantation,Coronary/peripheral artery bypass grafting,cerebrovascular accident,Transient ischemic attack or pulmonary embolism,Asymptomatic right bundle branch block was allowed;
